abstract: >-
  Data, code, figures, and numerical validation for the paper "The Power to
  Define Encounter: A Century of U.S. International Communication and Its
  Datafied Form". Covers 641,360,876 GDELT events over 153 months, with a
  130-month analysis window, under two entity coding bases.
